\f1\fs32 \cf3 \

\f0\fs26\fsmilli13333 \cf4 <\cf5 li\cf4 ><\cf5 div\cf4  class="\cf6 check-box\cf4 "></\cf5 div\cf4 >Do not commit to any school before May 1 \'97 compare all financial aid packages first</\cf5 li\cf4 >
\f1\fs32 \cf3 \

\f0\fs26\fsmilli13333 \cf4 <\cf5 li\cf4 ><\cf5 div\cf4  class="\cf6 check-box\cf4 "></\cf5 div\cf4 >If accepted, ask each school's financial aid office to match or improve competing offers</\cf5 li\cf4 >
\f1\fs32 \cf3 \

\f0\fs26\fsmilli13333 \cf4 <\cf5 li\cf4 ><\cf5 div\cf4  class="\cf6 check-box\cf4 "></\cf5 div\cf4 >If waitlisted, opt in immediately and follow each school's specific LOCI guidelines</\cf5 li\cf4 >
\f1\fs32 \cf3 \

\f0\fs26\fsmilli13333 \cf4 <\cf5 li\cf4 ><\cf5 div\cf4  class="\cf6 check-box\cf4 "></\cf5 div\cf4 >If denied, review your remaining strong options with fresh eyes \'97 they are genuinely competitive</\cf5 li\cf4 >
