\f0\fs26\fsmilli13333 \cf4 <\cf5 div\cf4  class="\cf6 sw-title\cf4 ">\uc0\u8594  Action Steps</\cf5 div\cf4 >
\f1\fs32 \cf3 \

\f0\fs26\fsmilli13333 \cf4 <\cf5 ol\cf4  class="\cf6 action-steps-list\cf4 ">
\f1\fs32 \cf3 \

\f0\fs26\fsmilli13333 \cf4 <\cf5 li\cf4 >Compile all your acceptance letters and financial aid packages in one place for comparison</\cf5 li\cf4 >
\f1\fs32 \cf3 \

\f0\fs26\fsmilli13333 \cf4 <\cf5 li\cf4 >Contact financial aid offices at your top choices to ask whether they will match competing offers \'97 this is standard, not presumptuous</\cf5 li\cf4 >
\f1\fs32 \cf3 \

\f0\fs26\fsmilli13333 \cf4 <\cf5 li\cf4 >Schedule campus visits or admitted students' day events before May 1 if you have not already</\cf5 li\cf4 >
\f1\fs32 \cf3 \

\f0\fs26\fsmilli13333 \cf4 </\cf5 ol\cf4 >
\f1\fs32 \cf3 \

\f0\fs26\fsmilli13333 \cf4 </\cf5 div\cf4 >
