\f0\fs26\fsmilli13333 \cf4 <\cf5 li\cf4 ><\cf5 div\cf4  class="\cf6 check-box\cf4 "></\cf5 div\cf4 >For research-track applicants: ask specifically about current NIH funding exposure and lab stability in your intended department</\cf5 li\cf4 >
\f1\fs32 \cf3 \

\f0\fs26\fsmilli13333 \cf4 <\cf5 li\cf4 ><\cf5 div\cf4  class="\cf6 check-box\cf4 "></\cf5 div\cf4 >Ask whether the specific labs or faculty you want to work with have had recent grant terminations or funding delays</\cf5 li\cf4 >
\f1\fs32 \cf3 \

\f0\fs26\fsmilli13333 \cf4 <\cf5 li\cf4 ><\cf5 div\cf4  class="\cf6 check-box\cf4 "></\cf5 div\cf4 >Research each target school's recent NIH funding history at the NIH RePORTER database (reporter.nih.gov)</\cf5 li\cf4 >
