\f0\fs26\fsmilli13333 \cf4 <\cf5 ol\cf4  class="\cf6 action-steps-list\cf4 ">
\f1\fs32 \cf3 \

\f0\fs26\fsmilli13333 \cf4 <\cf5 li\cf4 >Visit reporter.nih.gov to search NIH grant history for your target schools and departments</\cf5 li\cf4 >
\f1\fs32 \cf3 \

\f0\fs26\fsmilli13333 \cf4 <\cf5 li\cf4 >Contact faculty whose labs interest you directly to ask about current funding status \'97 this is appropriate and expected for research-track applicants</\cf5 li\cf4 >
