\f0  Action Checklist</\cf5 div\cf4 >
\f1\fs32 \cf3 \

\f0\fs26\fsmilli13333 \cf4 <\cf5 ul\cf4  class="\cf6 checklist\cf4 ">
\f1\fs32 \cf3 \

\f0\fs26\fsmilli13333 \cf4 <\cf5 li\cf4 ><\cf5 div\cf4  class="\cf6 check-box\cf4 "></\cf5 div\cf4 >Research the financial health of any private four-year institution you are considering \'97 enrollment declines can signal institutional instability</\cf5 li\cf4 >
\f1\fs32 \cf3 \

\f0\fs26\fsmilli13333 \cf4 <\cf5 li\cf4 ><\cf5 div\cf4  class="\cf6 check-box\cf4 "></\cf5 div\cf4 >For families targeting regional institutions, use enrollment cliff leverage to negotiate financial aid packages this spring</\cf5 li\cf4 >
\f1\fs32 \cf3 \

\f0\fs26\fsmilli13333 \cf4 <\cf5 li\cf4 ><\cf5 div\cf4  class="\cf6 check-box\cf4 "></\cf5 div\cf4 >Do not let anti-higher-education rhetoric distort your evaluation of good-fit schools \'97 the data on degree value remains strong</\cf5 li\cf4 >
