\f0\fs26\fsmilli13333 \cf4 <\cf5 ol\cf4  class="\cf6 action-steps-list\cf4 ">
\f1\fs32 \cf3 \

\f0\fs26\fsmilli13333 \cf4 <\cf5 li\cf4 >Check each target school's IPEDS data at nces.ed.gov for enrollment trends, graduation rates, and financial metrics</\cf5 li\cf4 >
\f1\fs32 \cf3 \

\f0\fs26\fsmilli13333 \cf4 <\cf5 li\cf4 >If you have received a merit aid offer from a regional institution, ask whether the financial aid office can improve it \'97 the enrollment cliff gives you real leverage</\cf5 li\cf4 >
\f1\fs32 \cf3 \

\f0\fs26\fsmilli13333 \cf4 <\cf5 li\cf4 >Research the specific programs and outcomes at your target schools rather than relying on institutional reputation alone</\cf5 li\cf4 >
\f1\fs32 \cf3 \

