\f0  <\cf5 strong\cf4 >Share this edition:</\cf5 strong\cf4 > Forward freely with attribution to <\cf5 em\cf4 >Higher Ed Insider</\cf5 em\cf4 >, Dr. Nathan Hurwitz. Subscribe at <\cf5 a\cf4  href="\cf6 https://www.hurwitzadmissions.com\cf4 ">www.hurwitzadmissions.com</\cf5 a\cf4 > or email <\cf5 a\cf4  href="\cf6 mailto:nathan@hurwitzadmissions.com\cf4 ">nathan@hurwitzadmissions.com</\cf5 a\cf4 >.</\cf5 div\cf4 >
